> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：射线延伸(ray_extend), 递减填充(shrinking_fill), 重涂色(recolor), 擦除(erase), 循环填充(cyclic_filling), 平移(translate), 对齐(align), 连线(connect), 印章覆盖(stamp_overlay), 计数(counting), 排序(sorting), 裁剪(crop), 镜像(mirror), 旋转(rotate), 填充(fill), 滑动(slide), 堆叠(stacking), 扩展(expand), 边框绘制(frame_drawing), 线段绘制(line_drawing), 对称补全(symmetry_completion)
> - 对象类：圆润对象(rounded_object), 边缘行程(side_run), 精灵体(sprite), 空心矩形(hollow_rect), 标记条(marker_bar), 控制像素(control_pixel), 目标对象(target_object), 对角带(diagonal_band), 调色板行(palette_row), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 引导标记(guide_marker), 分隔行(separator_row), 空心十字标记(hollow_plus_marker), 线段(line_segment), 贯穿条(full_span_bar), 接触标记(contact_marker), 表格单元(table_cell), 网格分隔线(grid_separator), 同色连通分量(same_color_comp), 障碍墙(obstacle_wall), 单色边框(monochrome_frame), 整幅画布(full_canvas), 单像素标记(singleton_marker), 缺角方形标记(missing_corner_marker), 十字前景(foreground_cross), 实心矩形(solid_rectangle), 延伸条纹(extension_stripe), 对称图案(symmetric_pattern), 掩码像素(masked_pixel), 边缘矩形(edge_rectangle), 轨迹条纹(trail_stripe), 控制像素对(control_pixel_pair), 行段(row_segment), 横带(horizontal_band), 平行四边形轮廓(parallelogram), 多色精灵体(multicolor_sprite), 嵌入标记像素(embedded_marker), 孤立控制点(isolated_control)
> - 空间关系类：四方外扩(four_way_expansion), 形状匹配(shape_match), 包含(containment), 射线命中(ray_intersection), 层深度递增(layer_depth_increasing), 锚点对齐(anchor_aligned), 同行同列对齐(same_row_column_alignment), 投射(perpendicular_cast), 频率统计(frequency_statistic), 同色分量依序连接(same_color_chain), 角落对应(corner_correspond), 交叉点中心(intersection_center), 侧边带对齐(side_strip_align), 接触边缘(touching_edge), 颜色配对(color_pairing), 括号界定提取范围(bracket_delimited_extraction), 按行排序(sorted_by_row), 对角分解(diag_decompose), 对称轨道映射(symmetry_orbit_mapping)
> - 条件/判断类：逐步缩短行程(progressively_shortened), 框内参考色传同形(boxed_color_to_match), 命中即整体擦除(hit_erases_whole), 层深模色板取色(depth_mod_palette_color), 跨面板搬运(cross_panel_move), 仅相邻锚点间连接(connect_only_between_adjacent_anchors), 命中处印标记(stamp_at_hit), 按计数升序(ascending_by_count), 绕障碍最短路径(shortest_detour), 唯一完整边框(unique_complete_frame), 翻转行序(row_reversal), 标记定旋转源目(marker_rot_src_tgt), 偶数切比雪夫距离(even_chebyshev_distance), 标记排除对应行列(marker_excludes_row_col), 滑至对侧边缘(slide_to_opposite), 锚点对齐目标(anchor_aligns), 按行序堆叠等宽段(equal_width_segments_stacked_in_row_order), 中点划分归属(midpoint_band_assignment), 标记为对顶点(markers_as_vertices), 全对称群轨道约束(full_symmetry_group_orbit_constraint)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

