>
> - 操作类：射线延伸(ray_extend), 重涂色(recolor), 裁剪(crop), 堆叠(stack), 平移(translate), 移动(move), 分解(decompose), 查表替换(lookup_replace), 旋转(rotation), 镜像(mirror/reflect), 计数(counting), 连线(draw_line), 填充(fill), 形状匹配(shape_matching), 对称补全(symmetry_completion), 透明叠加(transparent_overlay), 标记(mark), 拼接(concatenate), 滑动(shift), 对齐(align), 拉直(straighten)
> - 对象类：分隔线(divider_line/separator_line), 孤立像素(isolated_pixel), 画布边界(canvas_boundary), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 边缘线(edge_line), 标记块(marker_block), 提取区域(extracted_region), 十字图案(plus_pattern), 网格边缘(grid_edge), 条形段(bar_segment), 标记列(marker_column), 精灵体(sprite), 孔洞(hole), 矩形(rectangle), 障碍段(barrier_segment), 前景对象(foreground_object), 基本图元(primitive_shape), 图例面板(legend_panel), 编码块(encoded_block), 形状标记(shape_marker), 连通分量(connected_component), 对角线标记(diagonal_marker), 模板(template), 封闭孔洞(enclosed_hole), 单色对象(monochrome_object), 对称体(symmetric_object), 非对称体(asymmetric_object), 起点标记(start_marker), 终点标记(end_marker), 折线路径(folded_path), 二值掩码(binary_mask), 实心矩形(solid_rectangle), 间隙带(gap_strip), 前景掩码(foreground_mask), 线段(line_segment), 色段(color_run), 画布(canvas), 前景像素(foreground_pixel)
> - 空间关系类：朝向与背离(toward_and_away), 最近距离(nearest_distance), 行对齐配对(row_aligned_pair), 八方向发射(eight_dir_emit), 长度映射颜色(length_maps_color), 形状嵌合(shape_fitting), 互补拼合(complement_fit), 同轴对齐的矩形对(coaxial_rect_pair), 颜色与形状对应(color_shape_match), 数量决定边长(count_determines_side), 形状对应(shape_correspondence), 对称轴借用(axis_borrowed), 曼哈顿路径(manhattan_path), 列对齐(column_alignment), 双侧对齐(bilateral_alignment), 跨轴对称(cross_axis_symmetry), 居中放置(center_placed), 同行排列(row_arrangement), 双色互换(two_color_swap)
> - 条件/判断类：颜色决定射线方向(color_determines_ray_direction), 标记继承最近源色(marker_inherits_nearest_color), 按顺序堆叠(stacked_in_order), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 对角均匀色(diag_uniform_color), 基数方向循环填(cardinal_cyclic_fill), 固定编码表(fixed_encoding), 拼块填孔洞后变色(pieces_fill_holes_recolor), 障碍门处标记通道(barrier_gate_mark), 图元形状决定涂色(shape_determines_color), 旋转镜像等价匹配(rotation_reflection_match), 对角线输出(diagonal_output), 匹配形状决定填色(shape_determines_fill), 借轴复制非对称体(axis_replicates_asym), 折线连接(L_path_connection), 中心偏移选角(center_offset_selects_corner), 占用补集(occupancy_complement), 分隔色填充间隙(sep_color_fills_gap), 保留颜色与面积(keep_color_area), 边界对齐(edge_alignment), 仅交换两色(swap_two_colors_only)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

